  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1404.12 Notice of Denial. The commissioner shall send a notice of the denial of an application for an initial certificate of registration or renewal of a certificate of registration by certified mail to the last known address of the applicant or certificate holder.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #7462, eff 3-21-01; ss by #9416, INTERIM, eff 3-13-09, EXPIRED: 9-9-09\n\nNew. #9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17 (from Agr 1404.11) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
